-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Why choose LED soffit lighting for Florida homes?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">LED soffit lighting improves curb appeal, security, and energy efficiency with smart color and brightness controls. As a certified Gemstone Lights dealer, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living installs IP68-rated systems engineered for Florida's coastal humidity and salt-air conditions.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Is smart outdoor lighting energy efficient?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. LED lighting uses up to 80% less energy and lasts significantly longer than traditional bulbs, lowering long-term costs across your Florida property. Smart scheduling and dimming features give you full control over your home's exterior lighting from a smartphone app.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can I customize smart lighting colors and zones remotely?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Smart LED soffit systems allow full control of individual lighting zones, colors, and brightness levels directly from a smartphone app. You can set holiday color themes, event scenes, or scheduled timers — all managed remotely without any technical expertise required by Florida homeowners.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Does exterior LED lighting improve home security?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Well-placed exterior LED soffit lighting deters trespassers by eliminating dark zones around your home's perimeter. Motion-sensitive smart scheduling enhances visibility for security cameras and creates the impression of occupancy — providing Florida homeowners with passive, energy-efficient protection around the clock.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Is professional installation required for these systems?</h3><